WEBVTT

00:05.500 --> 00:10.540
A clean office starts with a clear plan.
If you're comparing commercial cleaning in

00:10.540 --> 00:16.380
Newcastle, ask three questions. What will
be cleaned? How often? And how will the

00:16.380 --> 00:21.780
standard be checked? Your Office Space
provides commercial and office cleaning

00:21.780 --> 00:27.260
for workplaces in Newcastle CBD and Lake
Macquarie. We start by understanding your

00:27.260 --> 00:33.680
space, how your team uses it, and what
needs attention. A site inspection informs

00:33.680 --> 00:39.180
a tailored proposal with the tasks,
frequency, access, and price agreed before

00:39.180 --> 00:44.900
service begins. Your scope may include
work areas, kitchens, amenities, rubbish

00:44.900 --> 00:50.260
removal, and floor care. Periodic detail
work and exclusions are clarified, so

00:50.260 --> 00:55.660
you're comparing the whole service. We aim
to keep a consistent cleaning team

00:55.660 --> 01:01.300
wherever possible, supported by documented
scopes and site notes. Sarah oversees

01:01.300 --> 01:05.360
monthly quality assurance against the
agreed Scope of Works, with a direct

01:05.360 --> 01:10.760
management pathway when something needs
attention. Need cleaning outside normal

01:10.760 --> 01:15.760
office hours? Timing, access, and security
arrangements are agreed around your

01:15.760 --> 01:20.400
workplace. And when your office gets
busier or your layout changes, it's time

01:20.400 --> 01:25.760
to review whether the cleaning schedule
still fits. For commercial and office

01:25.760 --> 01:30.480
cleaning in Newcastle CBD and Lake
Macquarie, start a conversation with Your

01:30.480 --> 01:36.860
Office Space. Visit yourofficespace.au
forward slash cleaning and request a

01:36.860 --> 01:37.500
cleaning quote.

